{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "92b032ad-ce4a-8348-b8ae-8929bff7d607",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:30:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Please excuse me, I am calling about the potholes on my street. Spring Street, I am at 439 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 439 Spring. Potholes, got it. What's it looking like out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, listen, after this storm it is worse. The snow turned to rain today and now the holes are full of water, you cannot see how deep. I hit one this morning going to my shop. Also, the paint on the crosswalk is so faded, and the cars do not stop for people. Nobody stops."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll happen with the plows scraping through. Faded crosswalk, noting that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Excuse me, one question. Does the city pay for the damage to the car? My tire is bent, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you it's covered, but there's a claim process you can file with the city. I can have someone send you the info. Is this a good number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is my kitchen phone, with the long cord, I am stretching it across the room. It is 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0151. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, can you add Spring Street to the repair list? It should be on the list already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for Spring Street today. Crews will be busy after this one, but it's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you."
    }
  ],
